# Paths EXCLUDED from the public, no-history copy of this repo.
# Maintainer-only trees (research, dev notes, agent config, private baselines)
# and build artifacts. One glob per line; '#' starts a comment.
# The owner uses this list when copying the repo to the new public repo.
dev-notes/
.claude/
validation/
experiments/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
# Local tool caches, OS/editor junk, and PyInstaller's generated spec files. The
# export copies the WORKING TREE and never reads .gitignore, so a git-ignored
# artifact ships unless it is also listed here -- these six reached a v1.1.0
# dry-run export (2.5 MB of .mypy_cache among them) before being caught.
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
*.spec
.venv/
.venv-build/
config.local.yaml
output/
tmp/
.git/
.superpowers/
.personal-tokens
docs/RELEASE_READINESS.md
docs/BETA_PLAN.md
docs/CLEAN_BUILD_TEST.md
docs/VALIDATION.md
docs/assessments/
docs/superpowers/
docs/history/
docs/future/input-scenarios.md
